{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-20",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "替人隐瞒胃出血  (Covering for the Chairwoman's Brother)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xingtian's chairwoman demands to know why Chun Yuqiao is in hospital with stomach bleeding, and Kaiwen takes the blame on himself to avoid exposing the chairwoman's younger brother. Listen to Xingzi and Kaiwen in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长，淳于总是急性胃出血，不过现在已经控制住了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "医生说他还得在医院住几天观察一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这次发病是酒精引起的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "董事长，都怪我不好，是我的一群朋友约我跟老大出去喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "当时我被他们灌多了，他们就在旁边起哄，非让老大也喝一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "然后老大为了替我挡酒，就喝了一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "明白，一直到老大身体康复，工作上的事情我们绝不打扰他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长，您慢走。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你不用谢我给你留面子，依我的意思，里子我都不想给你留。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你也知道这次玩得太过火了，没想到会这么严重是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你想知道老大昨晚怎么样了吗？催吐、洗胃、挂水、胃镜介入，还有手术准备和病危通知！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "拿着医药单找你姐报销去吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长，淳于总是急性胃出血，不过现在已经控制住了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, Mr Chun Yuqiao had acute stomach bleeding, though it is under control now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "医生说他还得在医院住几天观察一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The doctors say he still needs to stay in hospital for a few days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这次发病是酒精引起的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This flare-up was triggered by alcohol.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "董事长，都怪我不好，是我的一群朋友约我跟老大出去喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, it is all my fault; a group of my friends invited me and our boss out for drinks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "当时我被他们灌多了，他们就在旁边起哄，非让老大也喝一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They poured me too many drinks and started egging our boss on to drink a glass too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "然后老大为了替我挡酒，就喝了一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then our boss drank a glass in order to block the toast for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "明白，一直到老大身体康复，工作上的事情我们绝不打扰他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood — until our boss recovers fully, we will not disturb him with office matters.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长，您慢走。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take care on your way out, Chairwoman.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你不用谢我给你留面子，依我的意思，里子我都不想给你留。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Save your thanks for sparing your pride; left to me, I would not have spared you a shred of dignity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你也知道这次玩得太过火了，没想到会这么严重是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even you know you went too far this time and never expected it to turn this serious, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你想知道老大昨晚怎么样了吗？催吐、洗胃、挂水、胃镜介入，还有手术准备和病危通知！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Want to know what our boss went through last night? Induced vomiting, stomach pumping, IV drips, endoscopy, surgery prep, and a critical-condition notice!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "拿着医药单找你姐报销去吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take the hospital bill and ask your sister for reimbursement!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长，淳于总是急性胃出血，不过现在已经控制住了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "医生说他还得在医院住几天观察一下。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这次发病是酒精引起的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "董事长，都怪我不好，是我的一群朋友约我跟老大出去喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "当时我被他们灌多了，他们就在旁边起哄，非让老大也喝一杯。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "然后老大为了替我挡酒，就喝了一杯。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "明白，一直到老大身体康复，工作上的事情我们绝不打扰他。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "董事长，您慢走。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你不用谢我给你留面子，依我的意思，里子我都不想给你留。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你也知道这次玩得太过火了，没想到会这么严重是吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你想知道老大昨晚怎么样了吗？催吐、洗胃、挂水、胃镜介入，还有手术准备和病危通知！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "拿着医药单找你姐报销去吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Having shielded the rival director in front of his sister, Kaiwen delivers a stinging reminder of everything Yuqiao endured in the emergency room. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
